control: Each job kind connects as its own role, through a pool of its own
removes: the composition hands backfill delta sync's pool and delta sync backfill's, so each kind runs its statements under the other's role
packages: ./worker/app
tests: TestEachJobKindIsHandedThePoolOfItsOwnRole
scheduled-count: no

